ule involved in long term potentiation at hippocampal excitatory synapses through activation of p38MAPK (By similarity). May also regulate neurite outgrowth by activating the FGFR1 signaling pathway (By similarity). May play a role in synaptic plasticity (By similarity). Promotes localization of XKR8 at the cell membrane (PubMed:27503893)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}